            </note>
            <note corresp="#d96-f3" n="2" xml:id="d96-f3-content">
                <p>Beale’s statement has not been found.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d96-f4" n="3" xml:id="d96-f4-content">
                <p>There is no record of Lychowski taking up
                    this question with Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for Economic Affairs
                    Adair.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
